L0_1["BlackberryE description"] = "\226\156\170 Monster Fruit\nThrough occult rituals, blackberry has become a true demon, granting him unbelievable power!"
L0_1["CherryE description"] = "\226\156\170 Monster Fruit\nOnce the cherry twins wore these cursed outfits they felt that they really needed to kill something and unfortunately some outfits once worn can't be taken off\226\128\166"
L0_1["FigE description"] = "\226\156\170 Monster Fruit\nFig is the fruit of kings and the ancient Egyptians wrapped up a few for their Pharaohs."
L0_1["MushroomE description"] = "\226\156\170 Monster Fruit\nWith all the crazy drugs that mushroom was taking, it was only a matter of time before he turned into an immortal zombie."
L0_1["OrangeE description"] = "\226\156\170 Monster Fruit\nFor the past 500 years elder blood oranges have lived in Transylvania. Now that Fruitcraft has become a global phenomena they have decided to join in on the fun."
L0_1["CucumberC description"] = "\226\156\170 Ninja fruit\nA ninja from the Shinjiku clan, Cucumber has mastered all forms of Japanese weapons. Few have gone against him and survived."
L0_1["KiwiC description"] = "\226\156\170 Crazy fruit\nKiwi started out as a court jester and gradually learned more and more illusion magic from Grape. He cares dearly about putting on a great show."
L0_1["LemonC description"] = "\226\156\170 Acid warrior\nHe literally can't contain his acidity. Lemon is always looking for a fun way to splash acid on other fruits!"
L0_1["PomegranateC description"] = "\226\156\170 Strong warrior\nHailing from Turkey, Pomegranate started out as a butcher, but when a war broke out he went into the military.\n It wasn't long before he rose through the ranks."
L0_1["PearC description"] = "\226\156\170 Peaceful fruit\nPear is a lovable fruit. Always aiming to be the most beautiful woman in Fruitcraft, she's seen wearing elegant jewelry."
L0_1["Almond description"] = "\226\156\170 Sly nut\nEverything shiny makes him crazy! He's always planning challenging heists.\nWhen will he stop his craziness? Most likely never :)"
L0_1["Apple description"] = "\226\156\170 Cool fruit\nApple has a cool demeanor and sees all of life as a game.\nDon't let his whimsical temperament fool you, he always uses right tools for whatever job he's on."
L0_1["Banana description"] = "\226\156\170 Strong warrior\nHe has a mysterious past. We're convinced that he's from an old mystical tribe in the Amazon.\nHe's mostly found hanging out with his buddy Wilson."
L0_1["Blackberry description"] = "\226\156\170 Black magic fruit\nBlackberry is a lover of all things occult and is a powerful practitioner of dark magic.\nHe's usually seen hanging out with Banana."
L0_1["Carrot description"] = "\226\156\170 Barbarian fruit\nCarrot has been around since the time of the cave men. His fighting style may be primitive, however he makes up for it with brute strength."
L0_1["Cherry description"] = "\226\156\170 Twin fruit\nThe cherry twins are crazy about comics and manga.\nThey love to dress up as their favorite characters."
L0_1["Coconut description"] = "\226\156\170 Pirate warrior\nPirates in an exotic island adopted him when he was young and taught him all he knows.\nAfter years of hard work he's become the captain of his own ship."
L0_1["Corn description"] = "\226\156\170 Mexican fruit\nCorn is a Mexican patriot, looking to spread the great culture of his people to other fruits throughout Fruitcraft."
L0_1["Cucumber description"] = "\226\156\170 Ninja fruit\nA ninja from the Shinjiku clan, Cucumber has mastered all forms of Japanese weapons. Few have gone against him and survived."
L0_1["Date description"] = "\226\156\170 Desert fruit\nDate was a simple desert nomad, living a free and uncomplicated life.\nOne day exploring the dunes he discovered an old lamp with magical powers."
L0_1["Eggplant description"] = "\226\156\170 Super smart fruit\nEggplant is passionate about all subjects linked to science. She is incredibly intelligent and has worked with Einstein on several projects!"
L0_1["Fig description"] = "\226\156\170 Party fruit\nFig is a party animal. Always looking for the best party in town and hanging out in the loudest discos. His smooth moves always make him the center of any party."
L0_1["Garlic description"] = "\226\156\170 Stinky fruit\nGranny Garlic has an incredibly powerful odor. She's learned to use this stench to her advantage and manages to subdue her opponents without raising a finger."
L0_1["Grape description"] = "\226\156\170 Magical fruit\nGrape's strength lies in the multitude. The more 'awakened' grapes there are the more powerful he gets.\nHis skill lies in powerful illusion magic."
L0_1["Hazelnut description"] = "\226\156\170 Nature nut\nA true nature lover and beloved by squirrels. He takes care of Fruitcraft by planting seeds everywhere he goes."
L0_1["Kiwi description"] = "\226\156\170 Crazy fruit\nKiwi started out as a court jester and gradually learned more and more illusion magic from Grape. He cares dearly about putting on a great show."
L0_1["Lemon description"] = "\226\156\170 Acid warrior\nHe literally can't contain his acidity. Lemon is always looking for a fun way to splash acid on other fruits!"
L0_1["Lychee description"] = "\226\156\170 Honorable fruit\nLychee was trained in an ancient Chinese dojo founded by his ancestors. He only uses his skills for honorable causes."
L0_1["Mango description"] = "\226\156\170 Spiritual fruit\nMangos spend most of their time meditating on the secrets of life. That's why it is said that mangos are so delicious and bring spiritual healing."
L0_1["Mushroom description"] = "\226\156\170 Hippie fruit\nMushroom is a hippie. He likes to relax and enjoy music.\nHe's apposed to conflicts and his motto is 'make love not war'."
L0_1["Olive description"] = "\226\156\170 Strong warrior\nOlive is one of Zeus's sons. Living as a Spartan warrior when he was young, his demigod powers awakened as he gained more experience in battle."
L0_1["Orange description"] = "\226\156\170 Fire warrior\nHe is passionate and fiery.\nHis incredible strength lies in his ability to store up solar energy. That's where the fire comes from."
L0_1["Peach description"] = "\226\156\170 Kinky fruit\nPeach has particular interests that others might find unseemly, however this doesn't dampen her spirit and she lives life the way that she feels will make her happy."
L0_1["Pear description"] = "\226\156\170 Peaceful fruit\nPear is a lovable fruit. Always aiming to be the most beautiful woman in Fruitcraft, she's seen wearing elegant jewelry."
L0_1["Pineapple description"] = "\226\156\170 Surfer fruit\nA native of Hawaii, Pineapple spends most of his time on the beach. He's either chillin' with a drink, surfing the awesome waves or just hanging with friends."
L0_1["Pistachio description"] = "\226\156\170 Defensive fruit\nPistachio's strong armor protects him from all forms of damage. He usually acts as a defensive barrier."
L0_1["Pomegranate description"] = "\226\156\170 Strong warrior\nHailing from Turkey, Pomegranate started out as a butcher, but when a war broke out he went into the military.\n It wasn't long before he rose through the ranks."
L0_1["Strawberry description"] = "\226\156\170 Magical fruit\nShe's been training to improve her skills in the Angel Academy.\nShe secretly loves Pomegranate because of his funny looking mustache."
L0_1["Tomato description"] = "\226\156\170 Fat fruit\nTomato loves eating. He's technically a cannibal when he eats other tomatoes while eating a burger or using ketchup."
L0_1["Watermelon description"] = "\226\156\170 Big fruit\nWatermelon dreams of becoming the strongest fruit in all of Fruitcraft. He spends most of his time training with ridiculously large weights."
L0_1["Crystal CardPack Warning"] = "Cards from the crystal pack have very high enhancement limits however it is more costly to enhance them. Their recovery time is longer than usual but the recovery cost is fixed and very low."
L0_1["Pumpkin description"] = "\226\156\170 Punisher fruit\nA survivor of a Halloween massacre, Pumpkin has been searching for greater power to get revenge on those that wronged him and his family."
L0_1["SugarApple description"] = "\226\156\170 Odd fruit\nIn his search for power Apple managed to get his hands on a forbidden Mayan crystal, it made him super strong but pretty weird looking."
L0_1["Caqui description"] = "\226\156\170 Squishy fruit\nA soft and friendly fruit, she always tries to help others out."
L0_1["Star description"] = "\226\156\170 Aqua fruit\nA champion of the seven seas, star fruit has managed to gain the aqua crystal of power and gain the love of all see creatures."
L0_1["Dragon description"] = "\226\156\170 Legendary fruit\nThere is little known of this legendary fruit, only that no one has ever faced him and lived!"
L0_1["Xakhmi description"] = "\226\156\170\226\156\170 Scarface\n Exprienced warrior with deep scar on his face that is memento of a old war against dark forces. His exprience in battling makes him very powerful."
L0_1["Hushidar description"] = "\226\156\170\226\156\170 Grand Master\n Investigating about 1000 years around healing tricks , makes him The Grand Master of dark forest a.k.a Hushidar."
L0_1["Xebelus description"] = "\226\156\170\226\156\170 Master Of Agility\n Well-known hero that is in love with gold, gold and gold. He can find gold everywhere in easiest and fastest way. If you have gold, be careful about Xebelus."
L0_1["Sibilu description"] = "\226\156\170\226\156\170 Jack Of All Trades\n Sibi the Sheriff is a man of justice and honor. He deals with all kinds of villains from the fastest to the wisest and that's why he is a jack of all trades in battlefield"
